  {
    "id": "s1b",
    "segment": 1,
    "start": 10.5,
    "latest_end": 19.0,
    "text": "短而圆的翅膀、较长的宽尾，还有浅色的喉部，都是观察线索。",
    "duration": 6.552,
    "end": 17.052,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s1b.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s1b.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s1c",
    "segment": 1,
    "start": 26.0,
    "latest_end": 35.0,
    "text": "原声中，低一些的短叫和更尖的音节先后出现，节奏也有变化。",
    "duration": 6.888,
    "end": 32.888,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s1c.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s1c.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s1d",
    "segment": 1,
    "start": 36.0,
    "latest_end": 45.7,
    "text": "画面没有显示开口动作，不能把每一声都确定归给这只鸟。",
    "duration": 5.928,
    "end": 41.928,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s1d.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s1d.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s2a",
    "segment": 2,
    "start": 50.0,
    "latest_end": 58.8,
    "text": "灌丛里这组短叫，暂按新疆歌鸲，也就是夜莺来判断。",
    "duration": 5.856,
    "end": 55.856,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s2a.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s2a.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s2b",
    "segment": 2,
    "start": 62.0,
    "latest_end": 72.5,
    "text": "这种重复的短声更像警戒叫。鸟体被枝叶遮住，具体动作还看不清。",
    "duration": 7.656,
    "end": 69.656,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s2b.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s2b.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s3a",
    "segment": 3,
    "start": 78.0,
    "latest_end": 88.5,
    "text": "枝头这只是桤木纹霸鹟。灰橄榄色上体，白喉，翅上还有两道浅色翼斑。",
    "duration": 7.992,
    "end": 85.992,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s3a.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s3a.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s3b",
    "segment": 3,
    "start": 91.0,
    "latest_end": 100.5,
    "text": "它抬头张嘴，重复短促、带沙哑感的声句。相似的霸鹟，常要靠声音区分。",
    "duration": 8.472,
    "end": 99.472,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s3b.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s3b.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s4a",
    "segment": 4,
    "start": 105.0,
    "latest_end": 110.0,
    "text": "这里暂按长嘴沼泽鹪鹩判断。",
    "duration": 3.624,
    "end": 108.624,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s4a.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s4a.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s4b",
    "segment": 4,
    "start": 112.0,
    "latest_end": 123.4,
    "text": "短音与颤音交替，像一串串急促的轻响。鸟体被遮挡，具体动作看不清。",
    "duration": 8.112,
    "end": 120.112,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s4b.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s4b.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s5a",
    "segment": 5,
    "start": 127.4,
    "latest_end": 132.5,
    "text": "这只绒羽蓬松的雏鸟，是黑脚信天翁。",
    "duration": 4.248,
    "end": 131.648,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s5a.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s5a.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s5b",
    "segment": 5,
    "start": 138.5,
    "latest_end": 147.8,
    "text": "成鸟全身深褐，嘴基周围泛白。雏鸟把嘴凑向成鸟，成鸟也俯下头。",
    "duration": 8.256,
    "end": 146.756,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s5b.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s5b.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s5c",
    "segment": 5,
    "start": 149.0,
    "latest_end": 158.1,
    "text": "这是信天翁亲鸟喂食时常见的姿势，食物本身并不容易看清。",
    "duration": 6.456,
    "end": 155.456,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s5c.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s5c.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s6a",
    "segment": 6,
    "start": 162.0,
    "latest_end": 168.5,
    "text": "这些白头、白腹、黑色背翼的，是黑背信天翁。",
    "duration": 5.472,
    "end": 167.472,
    "audio_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s6a.wav",
    "word_timing_file": "/workspace/scratch/tts/s6a.json",
    "fits": true
  },
  {
